O0009 (MACRO DEMO: N EVENLY-SPACED OD GROOVES VIA A PARAMETRIC G65 MACRO)
(STOCK: 30MM OD X 50MM LENGTH ROUND BAR)
(DEMONSTRATES CUSTOM MACRO B: G65 ARGUMENT PASSING, A WHILE LOOP, AN IF/GOTO)
(EARLY-EXIT GUARD, AND ARITHMETIC EXPRESSIONS COMPUTING EACH GROOVE'S Z.)

G21 G40 G80
G54
G50 S3000

(===== FACING =====)
T0101
M03 S800
G96 S150
G00 X32 Z2
G01 Z0 F0.2
G00 X32 Z2
M00

(===== TURN BODY OD DOWN TO 24MM (T1) =====)
M08
G00 X32 Z0
G01 X24 Z0 F0.2
G01 Z-40 F0.15
G00 X32 Z-40
G00 X32 Z50
M09
M00

(===== CALL THE GROOVE-PATTERN MACRO (T5) =====)
(A=GROOVE COUNT  B=FIRST GROOVE'S FAR (NEAR-FACE) Z  C=SPACING BETWEEN GROOVES)
(W=GROOVE WIDTH  D=GROOVE TARGET DIAMETER  X=APPROACH/RETRACT CLEARANCE DIAMETER)
T0505
M03 S600
M08
G00 Z2
G00 X26
G65 P9010 A3 B-10 C10 W3 D18 X26
M09
M00

M05
M30
%

O9010 (MACRO: N EVENLY-SPACED OD GROOVES - SEE THE G65 CALL ABOVE FOR ARGUMENTS)
IF [#1 LE 0] GOTO 99
#10 = 0
WHILE [#10 LT #1] DO1
#11 = [#2 - #10 * #3]
#12 = [#11 - #23]
G00 X#24 Z#11
G75 R0.3
G75 X#7 Z#12 P1000 Q100 F0.08
G00 X#24
#10 = [#10 + 1]
END1
N99 M99
